<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Applied Materials upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Applied Materials upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Applied Materials Inc to buy from neutral, according to a Smith Barney source.</p>
<p>-- shares closed down 3/8 to 35-3/8 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
